      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Connection parameter update - Request a high priority, low latency connection. An application should only request high priority connection parameters to transfer large amounts of data over LE quickly. Once the transfer is complete, the application should request BluetoothGatt.CONNECTION_PRIORITY_BALANCED connection parameters to reduce energy use.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/bluetooth/BluetoothGatt#CONNECTION_PRIORITY_HIGH" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.bluetooth.BluetoothGatt.CONNECTION_PRIORITY_HIGH</code>.</a></format></para>
